 e will be a series of reflective works\, created through Tainsh's explorat
 ions of the more-than-human landscape of Lake Weyba\, Kabi Kabi Country. M
 any of these works have not been exhibited in Queensland. Peruse a mini li
 brary of books that will open your mind to the alternative and inspiring v
 iews that art\, radical research\, and Indigenous cosmology offer in the f
 ace of our polycrisis and detachment from the more-than-human world to whi
